w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.303ex\" height=\"1.595ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 576 705\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"210E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-210E\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is Planck's constant, e is the charge of electron.</p>\n<p>Statement II : <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.339ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.062ex\" height=\"1.885ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 1353.6 833\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4D\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(950,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> will emit photoelectrons of greater kinetic energy for the incident radiation having same frequency.</p>\n<p>In the light of the above statements, choose the most appropriate answer from the options given below.</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"Statement I is correct and Statement II is incorrect\n"},{"identifier":"B","content":"Statement I is incorrect but Statement II is correct\n"},{"identifier":"C","content":"Both Statement I and Statement II are correct\n"},{"identifier":"D","content":"Both Statement I and Statement II are incorrect"}],"correct_options":["A"],"explanation":"<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -8.902ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"42.772ex\" height=\"18.935ex\" rol